message: "Cite the manuscript, study protocol, and exact repository commit used."
title: "Geometry-Induced Soft-State Forecasting Research"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Kumar"
    given-names: "Mohit"
repository-code: "https://github.com/MohitKumarRostock/Kernel_Affine_Hull_Koopman_Machine"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Research materials for predictive enrichment of geometry-induced soft-state
  abstractions, with KAHM, affine, and positive-kernel reconstruction controls.
  The repository preserves separate prior forecasting and Koopman-architecture
  studies. Information retention, fitted forecasting accuracy, and autonomous
  linear closure are distinct scientific questions.
keywords:
  - forecasting
  - geometric representations
  - kernel methods
  - reproducibility
